 CVE-2026-91767: include wildcard prefix in the length bound.
 CVE-2026-91769: suppress CN fallback for DNS, URI, and SRV service IDs.
 Preserve upstream's IP-only SAN compatibility behavior.
 Adapt bool/function names/TSRMLS to PHP 5.6; retain all supplier patches.
